sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client API
    participant API as API Bevoac
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SB as Service Bus
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Azure as Azure Client

    Client->>API: POST /v1/scans sans tenantId/customerId
    API->>DB: API key -> tenant_id interne
    API->>DB: Verifie tenant_azure_scopes / tenant_web_targets
    API->>DB: Verifie quota mensuel et plan resource_limit
    API->>DB: Insert scans=PENDING + ledger
    API->>SB: scan.requested version 2026-04-28
    API-->>Client: 201 scanId
    SB->>Worker: message scan.requested
    Worker->>DB: status=IN_PROGRESS
    Worker->>Azure: Resource Graph preflight si modules infra
    alt ressources <= limite plan
        Worker->>Azure: Modules web / Entra / infra
        Worker->>DB: result JSON + status DONE ou FAILED
    else ressources > limite plan
        Worker->>DB: status FAILED + RESOURCE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
    end
    Client->>API: GET /v1/scans/{scanId}
    API-->>Client: status + result JSON
    Client->>API: GET /v1/scans/{scanId}/pdf
    API-->>Client: rapport PDF
